Alembic migrations for the TutorMatch PostgreSQL schema.

Run from the backend directory with `DATABASE_URL` set:

```powershell
.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m alembic upgrade head
```

The initial revision creates the users, security answers, profiles, refresh
tokens, conversations, messages, events, and read-cursor tables. The application
does not create tables automatically; apply migrations before starting it with
`STORAGE_BACKEND=postgres`.
